            "body": "> arbitrary fallback like 50\r\n\r\nI didn't choose this value 🤷‍♂️ \r\nIt is from [Vim](https://github.com/vim/vim/blob/f1b454912996d6417acd0d738de0eb7b60902c56/src/buffer.c#L4977), and it was also used here before https://github.com/neovim/neovim/commit/3344cffe7bf77c984550c01f9405f4d757150d8a.",
